From: YanIanZ <iwayanbagusaryadarma@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:08:19 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft - keep save tickets across region merge and split

A region holding an unconsumed save ticket (save-all, an AWF world save)
that merged into another or split reported the save complete from
onRegionDestroy although its chunks were not saved, and the regions that
now own them carried no ticket. On merge the ticket moves to the merge
target (coalescing with a ticket already there); on split it is split
into one part per new region and reported once every part has saved.

propagateSaveAllTicket's future is completed off the calling thread: the
ticket's callback can run under the regioniser's write lock, where a
synchronous dependent re-entering the regioniser would deadlock. A
reported failure still wins over the completion that follows it.

diff --git a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TickRegions.java b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TickRegions.java
index aa0418219db400a05d8af99d744482da7a48ba46..590ccdfcf9e046e3e096310568d2bb8a1dfe1a99 100644
--- a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TickRegions.java
+++ b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TickRegions.java
@@ -314,12 +314,9 @@ public final class TickRegions implements ThreadedRegionizer.RegionCallbacks<Tic
         @Override
         public CompletableFuture<Void> propagateSaveAllTicket(final boolean flush) {
             final CompletableFuture<Void> future = new CompletableFuture<>();
-            this.canvas$saveAllTicket.propagate(new SaveAllTicket(
-                () -> {
-                    future.complete(null);
-                },
-                future::completeExceptionally, flush
-            ));
+            // SourbyCraft - completed off the calling thread: the ticket's callback can run under the
+            // regioniser's write lock (a region destroyed holding it), where a dependent must not run
+            this.canvas$saveAllTicket.propagate(SaveAllTicket.completing(future, flush));
             return future;
         }
 
@@ -555,6 +552,17 @@ public final class TickRegions implements ThreadedRegionizer.RegionCallbacks<Tic
 
             // task queue
             this.taskQueueData.split(regioniser, into);
+
+            // SourbyCraft start - a pending save ticket follows the chunks it was asked to save: one part
+            // per new region, reported once every part has saved (onRegionDestroy would report it now)
+            final SaveAllTicket pendingSave = this.canvas$saveAllTicket.pop();
+            if (pendingSave != null) {
+                final java.util.Iterator<SaveAllTicket> parts = pendingSave.split(regions.size()).iterator();
+                for (final var region : regions) {
+                    region.getData().canvas$saveAllTicket.propagate(parts.next());
+                }
+            }
+            // SourbyCraft end - a pending save ticket follows the chunks it was asked to save
         }
 
         @Override
@@ -593,6 +601,8 @@ public final class TickRegions implements ThreadedRegionizer.RegionCallbacks<Tic
 
             // task queue
             this.taskQueueData.mergeInto(data.taskQueueData);
+            // SourbyCraft - a pending save ticket moves to the region that now owns the chunks
+            this.canvas$saveAllTicket.forwardTo(data.canvas$saveAllTicket);
             SchedulerUtil.getHandle().onRegionMerge(this, data, world); // Canvas - region profiler
         }
     }
